的方法来增大对弹簧的拉力，其设计的实验装置如图2所示。实验中保持弹簧伸长沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"OC"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向不变。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4963f140aabf3dad7e70dd8e0657a3ffa613f8ca93cddc2fdca148fe03053ddf.png","width":352,"height":403,"width_mm":41.214,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/48c8461de5615e9abd438e3e9e2fca935726d62d5b652280becda8de62208720.png","width":426,"height":379,"width_mm":50.046,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图1\n（1）图 1 中弹簧指针位置的读数为 （填空） cm;\n（2）图 2 实验中测力计的示数如图 3 所示，其读数为 （填空） N;\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0221991f40cb1defd82f53bc6330ee89e2e6ac21194c8a136b27f6f2524688de.png","width":353,"height":328,"width_mm":41.398,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图4\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/08b217176e870f6df5859ddc77540ff1ab690b0ebd704d852fdbebd28e799c5a.png","width":418,"height":309,"width_mm":49.126,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图3\n（3）如图4所示，该同学已在白纸上画出了绳套拉力的方向 "},{"type":"math","value":"OA"},{"type":"text","value":" 、被测弹簧受到的拉力方向 "},{"type":"math","value":"OC"},{"type":"text","value":" 和测力计拉绳的方向 "},{"type":"math","value":"OB"},{"type":"text","value":" （大小如图3所示）。请你用力的图示法在答卷上作出弹簧所受的拉力，并从图中得出弹簧此时所受拉力的大小为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" （结果保留两位有效数字）。\n14-II.（3分）（1）某物理小组同学尝试用两个平面镜做类似双缝干涉测量光的波长实验。两平面镜 "},{"type":"math","value":"M_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"M_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的放置如图1所示，两镜面相交于垂直于纸面的 "},{"type":"math","value":"O(O')"},{"type":"text","value":" 线，且夹角接近 "},{"type":"math","value":"180^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。垂直纸面的线光源 S 发出单色光照射两平面镜，能在光屏上观察到明暗相间的条纹。关于本实验，下列说法正确的是 （填空）（多选）；\nA. 光屏上观察到的条纹是等间距的\nB. 光源 S 关于两平面镜的虚像 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 可视为两个相干光源\nC. 其他条件不变，仅把光屏右移，光屏上的条纹间距会变大\nD. 若把两镜面间的夹角增大到 "},{"type":"math","value":"180^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，光屏上仍可观察到明暗相间的条纹\n(2) 另一组同学在做 “薄膜干涉” 实验时, 分别用红光和蓝光照射薄膜, 形成的干涉图样如图 2 中 A 和 B 所示, 其中图 （填空） (选填 “A” 或 “B”) 是红光形成的干涉图样。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0aa77e6ae51b00ea2b046434e79882bb5e5ac168afd247e0afcbc81439989633.png","width":251,"height":288,"width_mm":29.439,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/30927690fc9caff1a4ad453306997987a14dab47ebe972780699328e4fc07a6f.png","width":235,"height":288,"width_mm":27.415,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA\nB\n第14-Ⅱ题图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3444233d3279a4a14ea18898b31454cba80621963d96e580f8eeaf3c41b6d46c.png","width":490,"height":340,"width_mm":57.589,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—II题图1\n"},{"type":"math","value":"14"},{"type":"text","value":"-Ⅲ.（5分）某同学为了测量一节干电池的电动势和内阻，设计了如图1所示的电路。（1）用该方案测得的电源电动势与真实值相比：（填空）（选填“偏大”、“偏小”或“等大”），测得的内阻与真实值相比：（填空）（选填“偏大”、“偏小”或“等大”）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eec0fb5a91891ce61b80c2969b8cf6bf8995beb4e09eb5cbb8274d4fd85d4dda.png","width":288,"height":277,"width_mm":33.854,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—III题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/37b0b6399ebc83ca7d32bcc96b518a79e63d6a6c1e0493de5f362e1c6210d366.png","width":422,"height":277,"width_mm":49.494,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14—III 题图 2\n(2) 为了提高实验的精度, 该同学设计了另一个实验方案如图 2 所示, 正确连线后, 实验操作如下:\n①将滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑片移到最左端, 闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n②调节滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑片, 使得灵敏电流计 "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":" 的指针指向 0 , 记录此时电压表的示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电流表的示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n③接着, 改变滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑片位置后, 再重复步骤②, 记录另一组数据 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(i) 图 2 设计的方案, 消除了图 1 测量中哪个因素对实验结果的影响 （填空）。\nA. 电压表内阻    B. 电流表内阻\n(ii) 待测电源电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空），内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）（用题中所给的物理量符号表示）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I（1）10.00cm（9.98～10.02范围内均对）（1分）\n(2) 3.60N (3.58～3.62 范围内均对) (1 分)\n（3）作图正确（2分。要求标度合理、力的图示和平行四边形规范），6.0N（5.5～6.5范围内均对）（2分）\n14-II （1）ABC（2分，漏选得1分） （2）B（1分）\n14-III （1）等大（1分） 偏大（1分）\n(2) (i) B (1分) (ii)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{I_{2}U_{1}-I_{1}U_{2}}{I_{2}-I_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_{1}-U_{2}}{I_{2}-I_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504","source_question_id":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ddfbb6a02c96e0f200c1bba5c41de0fcb7fd4359662f72995771b77433a46c94","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （8分）如图所示，在一绝热性能良好的封闭气缸内，有一装有小阀门K（不计K的大小）的绝热活塞。在气缸的A端装有电热丝，用于加热气体。刚开始，活塞紧贴气缸B端的内壁，阀门K关闭；整个气缸内盛有一定质量的某种理想气体，其温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知该理想气体的内能U与热力学温度T成正比，即U=aT，式中a是与物质的量成正比的已知量。忽略活塞与气缸内壁之间的摩擦。\n①现用外力把活塞从气缸的 B 端压至气缸中央，并用销钉 F 把活塞固定，从而把气缸分成体积相等的左右两室。上述压缩过程中，气体的温度上升到 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n②然后开启阀门 K，经过足够长的时间后再将它关闭，再拔除销钉 F，让活塞可自由移动。\n用电热丝加热气体，加热完毕并经过一定时间后，活塞再次静止。此时左室内气体的压强变为 K 关闭后的 2.5 倍，右室内气体的体积变为 K 关闭后的 0.5 倍。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d698ecff74b5ad04456f9b0d28dd7f6d9008a4790620c75666d4c460429a303d.png","width":364,"height":248,"width_mm":42.686,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1) ①中气体分子的平均速率 （填空） (选填 “增大”、“减小”或 “不变”), 外力对气体做功大小为 （填空）;\n（2）活塞再次静止时，左、右两室内气体的温度分别是多少；\n（3）电热丝加热过程共传给气体的热量是多少。\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n（1）增大（1分），"},{"type":"math","value":"W=\\Delta U=a(T_{2}-T_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）由于对于一定质量的理想气体，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{pV}{T} = C"},{"type":"text","value":"由题意可知，加热前左右两边压强相等，设为 p；体积也相等，设为 V。加热后左右两室气体温度分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n则有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{pV}{T_{2}}=\\frac{2.5p\\times1.5V}{T_{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{pV}{T_{2}}=\\frac{2.5p\\times0.5V}{T_{B}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{A}=\\frac{15}{4}T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{B}=\\frac{5}{4}T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n（3）对气缸内气体整体而言，气体不对外做功，加热前经绝热膨胀后左右两室气体物质的量相同，气体吸收的热量等于内能的变化量。则有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta Q = \\Delta U_{\\mathrm{A}} + \\Delta U_{\\mathrm{B}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta Q = \\frac{1}{2} aT_{\\mathrm{A}} - \\frac{1}{2} aT_{2} + \\frac{1}{2} aT_{\\mathrm{B}} - \\frac{1}{2} aT_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta Q = \\frac{3}{2} aT_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504","source_question_id":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9277ec13045065dab54f59fcef148c7928ab5109f224f9dee311e25ab99e8ebd","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）某游戏装置如图所示，水平传送带左端A点和右端B点分别与两个光滑水平台面平滑对接，A、B两点间的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=0.5m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。左侧水平台面上有一被压缩的弹簧，弹簧的左端固定，右端与一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=0.1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块P接触（P与弹簧不栓接，且滑上传送带前已经脱离弹簧），P与传送带间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" 。右侧水平台面上有一倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，高 "},{"type":"math","value":"h=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的固定光滑斜面（水平台面与斜面底端用平滑小圆弧连接），在斜面左侧水平台面上放置一质量也为m的相同滑块Q，右侧固定一上表面光滑且很大的水平桌面。桌面上放置一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M=0.1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，长 "},{"type":"math","value":"s=0.6m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的薄木板EF（厚度不计），木板左端E点与桌面左端相齐、并与斜面顶端D点等高，且DE间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{DE}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。游戏开始，将P从压缩弹簧的右端由静止释放，与静止在水平台面上的Q发生碰撞后粘在一起组成滑块W，W离开斜面后将在木板EF的上表面与木板发生弹性碰撞（碰撞时间极短），每次碰撞前后瞬间，W沿竖直方向的分速度大小不变、方向反向。P、Q、W均可视为质点，不计空气阻力。在某次游戏中，W恰好击中木板EF的中点。\n（1）求 W 离开 D 点时的速度大小；\n（2）若传送带不动，求弹簧最初储存的弹性势能；若传送带转动，则弹簧最初储存的弹性势能的大小范围；\n（3）W击中木板 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 中点后瞬间，W和木板的速度分别为多大；\n（4）若 W 落在桌面上时不反弹，则 W 在桌面上的落点与桌面左端间的距离为多少。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7d8096796283ad020b37c3853fe2dc4280bd3153f63f0b5572d13272a827037e.png","width":989,"height":238,"width_mm":116.282,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）\n（1）滑块 W 在离开 D 点后做斜抛运动，水平位移为 0.5m，且光滑斜面倾角为"},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，滑块 W 离开 D 点后水平和竖直方向的速度分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = v_{y} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} v_{D}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n根据斜抛运动特点，有："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}=gt,\\quad v_{x}\\times2t=L_{DE}+\\frac{1}{2}s"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n则 W 离开 D 点时的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}=\\sqrt{2}v_{x}=\\sqrt{5}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n（2）设P、Q碰前P的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{P}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，碰后W的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{W}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。根据机械能和动量守恒，有"},{"type":"math","value":"m v _ {\\mathrm{P}} = m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {\\mathrm{W}}, \\frac {1}{2} m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {\\mathrm{W}} ^ {2} = m _ {\\mathrm{W}} g h + \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {D} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{P}} = 6\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n①传送带不动\n由动能定理得 "},{"type":"math","value":"E _ {p} - \\mu m g L = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {\\mathrm{P}} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据得 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p} = 2 \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n②传送带转动\n若是逆时针转动，由于 P 的运动与上小题相同，则弹簧最初储存的弹性势能也为 2J。若是顺时针转动，P 被加速，当在传送带上全程被加速时，对应的弹簧最初储存的弹性势能最小。\n由动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p} + \\mu mgL = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{p}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，代入数据得，"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p} = 1.6 J"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1 分）\n所以，传送带转动时，弹簧最初储存的弹性势能至少为 1.6J。\n（3）W击中木板"},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":"中点后瞬间，W和木板的速度分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{W1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{\\text{板}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{W1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"的水平、竖直分速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{W1x}}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{W1y}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。由斜抛运动规律、水平方向动量守恒及碰撞前后动能不变，可知："},{"type":"math","value":"m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {x} = m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {\\mathrm{W1} x} + M v _ {\\text{板}}, \\frac {1}{2} m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {x} ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} m _ {\\mathrm{W}} v _ {\\mathrm{W1} x} ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2} M v _ {\\text{板}} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\mathrm{W} 1 x} = \\frac {m _ {\\mathrm{w}} - M}{m _ {\\mathrm{w}} + M} v _ {x} = \\frac {1}{3} v _ {x} = \\frac {\\sqrt {1 0}}{6} \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n板的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\text{板}} = \\frac {2 m _ {\\mathrm{w}}}{m _ {\\mathrm{w}} + M} v _ {x} = \\frac {4}{3} v _ {x} = \\frac {2 \\sqrt {1 0}}{3} \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\nW 的速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\mathrm{W} 1} = \\sqrt {v _ {y} ^ {2} + v _ {\\mathrm{W} 1 x} ^ {2}} = \\frac {5}{3} \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（4）当滑块 W 落在木板中点碰后上升到最大高度的时间为："},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{v_{y}}{g}=\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{20}s"},{"type":"text","value":"则，滑块 W 与木板碰撞后反弹再落到碰前高度时，与木板的水平位移差为，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4}{3}v_{x}\\times2t-\\frac{1}{3}v_{x}\\times2t=0.5m>\\frac{1}{2}s=0.3m"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n落点距 E 点距离为："},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{1}{3}v_{x}\\times2t+\\frac{1}{2}s=\\frac{7}{15}m"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504","source_question_id":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cd9a1ae4eb8717dc27a33c6ac58124370b46d215f8b1c840eb3622c1e70f0177","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）海浪蕴含着丰富的能量，某科技小组设计了一种把海浪能转化为电能的装置。示意图如图所示，足够长的圆柱形磁体和圆筒形磁体通过缆绳锚定于海底礁石上，两者之间存在沿水平方向的径向磁场。线圈与浮桶相连套在圆柱形磁体上，并可随海浪沿竖直方向运动。一额定功率 P=25W 的灯泡通过导线与浮桶中的线圈相连，线圈所在处的磁感应强度大小均为 B=1T。某段时间内，浮桶和线圈随海浪上下做简谐运动，周期 T=2s，振幅 "},{"type":"math","value":"A=\\frac{5}{\\pi}m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，通过平衡位置时的速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此过程中灯泡恰好正常发光。浮桶和线圈的总质量 m=20kg，在浮桶和线圈上下运动过程中，沿竖直方向受到的作用力有重力、浮力、安培力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、海水阻力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和海浪对浮桶和线圈的作用力 F，其中重力和浮力大小相等，海水阻力大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}=kv(k=10kg/s)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，v 为线圈的瞬时速率。已知每匝线圈周长 L=0.4m，每匝线圈电阻 r=0.2"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，线圈匝数 N=10。t=0 时刻浮桶和线圈正通过平衡位置向上运动。不计其他电阻。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/488dee0c5502010f144010bb5b9cfcd163b8df75e438ba872f19721b0d8f6a75.png","width":332,"height":489,"width_mm":38.822,"row_group":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n（1）t=0 时刻线圈中的电流方向为顺时针还是逆时针（俯视）；\n（2）求灯泡电阻 R，并写出灯泡两端电压 u 随时间 t 的变化关系；\n（3）t=0.5s 到 t=1s 内海浪对浮桶和线圈的冲量大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和所做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W_{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)\n（1）逆时针.... (1分)\n（2）线圈做简谐运动，故产生正弦式交流电，其最大值为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{m}} = NBLv_{\\mathrm{m}} = 20V"},{"type":"text","value":"此时小灯泡恰好正常发光，由"},{"type":"math","value":"P = (\\frac{\\frac{E_{\\mathrm{m}}}{\\sqrt{2}}}{R + Nr})^2 R"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"R = 2\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":".... (2分)\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻浮桶和线圈正通过平衡位置，故线圈中瞬时电压"},{"type":"math","value":"e = NBLv_{m}\\cos \\frac{2\\pi}{T}t"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"e = 20\\cos \\pi t"},{"type":"text","value":"(V)\n则灯泡两端电压"},{"type":"math","value":"u = \\frac{e}{R + Nr}R"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"u = 10\\cos \\pi t"},{"type":"text","value":"(V).... (2分)\n（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 1s"},{"type":"text","value":"内，线圈和浮桶速率从0增加到"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{m}} = 5\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动量定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F} - \\sum F_{\\text{安}}\\Delta t - \\sum F_{f}\\Delta t = mv_{\\mathrm{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（或"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F} - F_{\\text{安}}\\Delta t - F_{f}\\Delta t = mv_{\\mathrm{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"）.... (1分)\n其中电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{NBLv}{R + Nr} = v"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}} = NBIL = 4v"},{"type":"text","value":".... (1分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F} = \\sum F_{\\text{安}}\\Delta t + \\sum F_{f}\\Delta t + mv_{\\mathrm{m}}"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\mathrm{F}} = (\\sum 14v\\Delta t + 100)\\mathrm{N}\\cdot \\mathrm{s} = (14A + 100)\\mathrm{N}\\cdot \\mathrm{s} = (\\frac{70}{\\pi} + 100)\\mathrm{N}\\cdot \\mathrm{s} = 122.3\\mathrm{N}\\cdot \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n由动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{F} - W_{F_{\\mathrm{f}}} - Q = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\mathrm{m}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":".... (1分)\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{\\frac{E_{\\mathrm{m}}}{\\sqrt{2}}}{R + Nr})^{2}(R + Nr)T = 25\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":".... (1分)\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}} = 4v"},{"type":"text","value":"，类比"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f} = 10v"},{"type":"text","value":"，由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Q}{W_{F_{\\mathrm{f}}}} = \\frac{F_{\\text{安}}\\Delta x}{F_{f}\\Delta x} = \\frac{F_{\\text{安}}}{F_{f}} = \\frac{2}{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{F_{\\mathrm{f}}} = 62.5\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":".... (1分)\n综上得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{F} = W_{F_{\\mathrm{f}}} + Q + \\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\mathrm{m}}^{2} = 337.5\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":".... (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-ermo-2504","source_question_id":"ningbo-ermo-2504-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cd2c9e6f7eac92a363f293eea9eaf7cf2823d16bd6abe227c49e089e17f93edc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）如图所示，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面内有一平行于 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴宽为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的线状电子源，每秒沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向均匀发射 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},